SUMMARY:Charles Dickens’ Christmas Dinner. The Orchard Inn & Spa ~ Salud
 a\, N.C.
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**The Charles Dickens’ Christmas D
 inner is a fabulous 4-course dinner with readings from Dickens’ “A Chr
 istmas Carol” as you dine. It is being held at the beautiful Orchard Inn
  and Spa in Saluda\, N.C. We will be attending on the second Saturday in D
 ecember.**\n\n**DINNER /COST:** **Hors d’oeuvres will be served at 6:00 
 PM and dinner will be served at 6:30 PM. Dinner will end in candlelight by
  the roaring fire with a Smoking Bishop (type of mulled wine).**\n\n**Cost
  is $110 plus tax and 20% gratuity. You will pay your bill after dinner.**
 \n\n**MENU/WEBSITE:** **Orchardinn.com. Please go to Special Events under 
 DINING ~ Newmans Restaurant ~ and scroll down to Charles Dickens’ Dinner
 s. The Christmas menu includes roasted duck\, salmon\, and lamb shrank jus
 t to name a few main courses. Sounds delicious! 😋**\n\n**DRESS:** **Dre
 ssy casual. Men are asked to wear dinner jackets\, but it’s not strictly
  required. The atmosphere is warm & welcoming\, and considered an elegant 
 fine-dining experience.**\n\n**I hope you will join me during this special
  time of the year! 🎄 🧑🏻‍🎄 🦌**\n\n****************IMPORTAN
 T: If you must cancel your RSVP please do so at least 48 hours prior to th
 e meetup time of 6:00 PM. The Orchard Inn must have a complete headcount b
 y then.**\n\n**QUESTIONS/CONCERNS:**\n**Shae.Kemerer@aol.com**\n**(828)699
 -8180 (text or call)**
